<?xml version="1.0"?>
<ScenContainer xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema">
  <ScenTitle>Irish-Spanish Fish War, 2015</ScenTitle>
  <ScenDescription>&lt;BODY scroll=auto&gt;&lt;P&gt;This scenario assumes that tensions have increased between Ireland and Spain.&amp;nbsp; Ireland has responded by closing&amp;nbsp;its Exclusive Economic Zone (EEZ) to Spanish fishing boats.&amp;nbsp; However, there have been reports of Spanish trawlers continuing to fish in Irish waters, and that Spain has even sent military vessels to make sure its&amp;nbsp;fishing boats are not harassed.&amp;nbsp; Ireland, not surprisngly, considers this a breach of international law and a gross provocation.&amp;nbsp; &lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt"&gt;-------------------------------------------------------&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ideograph-numeric; mso-layout-grid-align: auto; punctuation-wrap: hanging; mso-vertical-align-alt: auto"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ideograph-numeric; mso-layout-grid-align: auto; punctuation-wrap: hanging; mso-vertical-align-alt: auto"&gt;At the time this scenario was written,&amp;nbsp;boardings and inspections were&amp;nbsp;not modeled in Command.&amp;nbsp; For game purposes, it has been assumed an inspection can be modeled in Command by&amp;nbsp;matching course and speed&amp;nbsp;with&amp;nbsp;the ship&amp;nbsp;that is to be&amp;nbsp;inspected, closing to within a few hundred yards of that vessel, and remaining there for&amp;nbsp;at least one&amp;nbsp;hour.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;A delta template .ini file has been included in the .zip file to assist in updating the scenario to any future versions of the database.&amp;nbsp; &lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt"&gt;Scenario Author: Mark Gellis&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/BODY&gt;</ScenDescription>
